"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This ancient map depicts the area surrounding Moonrise Towers in detail, depicting a profusion of local fauna (deer, rabbits, black bears) and flora, with special emphasis placed on areas for prolific foraging.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This map can be read by any party member, but cannot be examined, picked up.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203255\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1073/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19392/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5196/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 932809/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.056      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   36.056      1 -total\n 46.34%   16.710      4 Template:Icon_text\n 42.02%   15.151     11 Template:Trim\n 24.98%    9.007      2 Template:Uid\n 18.53%    6.682      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.73%    5.312      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.99%    4.323      1 Template:Notes\n 11.77%    4.242      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.63%    4.192      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:50566-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203255 and revision id 394778. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}